or nursing excellence, achieved by only about 10% of hospitals worldwide. Magnet with Distinction is awarded to the highest-performing Magnet organizations, with only a select few earning this prestigious honor. This recognition reflects our commitment to transformational leadership, professional nursing excellence, innovation, exceptional patient outcomes, and an empowering practice environment where nurses thrive.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Under the direct supervision of a registered nurse in the assigned department, performs a wide variety of patient care activities in support of unit activity. This includes preparation and assistance with patient examinations, administering medications, drawing blood, collecting and preparing laboratory tests and patient education. Position requires initiative, able to prioritize critical demands and the ability to work in a team environment.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"The 4th floor of Jacobs Medical Center is a 36 bed Surgical Progressive Care Unit specializing in Advanced Surgical Procedures, Oncology related surgeries and Abdominal Transplant.","source_heading":"DESCRIPTION","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"qualification","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Licensed Vocational Nurse (LVN) - issued by the state of California.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Proven knowledge of universal precautions and proper use of body mechanics.","source_heading":"MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS","source_subheading":null}],"pay":{"salary_min":38.09,"salary_max":47.35,"salary_period":"hour","annual_min":79227.20000000001,"annual_max":98488.0,"annual_comparison":88857.6,"status":"usable","source":"scalar:hiring_pay_scale","source_heading":"hiring pay sc